          "alt": "An illustration depicting pneumonia in human lungs with a pie chart callout of pneumonia types that reads 65% NV-HAP and 35% VAP",
          "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sage/c/oral-care-for-all/images/Oral-Care-for-All-pneumonia-illustration.jpg",
          "borderColor": "rgba(76,125,122,1)",
